  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to prevent the transmission of HIV/AIDS from mother to child.Young, drug-using women lack knowledge of reproductive health and do not adequately use common health and maternal care services. Health care staff will get training in RH, maternal and child care specifically designed to deal with young HIV-inf women.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning av h&#xe4;lso- och social personal om hur man b&#xe4;ttre ger st&#xf6;d till unga, drogmissbrukande kvinnor, m&#xe5;nga med HIV. Detta f&#xf6;r att ge dem v&#xe5;rd och st&#xf6;d i god tid innan barnet f&#xf6;ds. &#xc4;ven utbildning i RH till specialister samt om barnh&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd i syfte att ge ev &#xf6;vergivna barn b&#xe4;ttre v&#xe5;rd.</narrative>
  </description>
